      <title>India’s Voter Roll Revision: What Is SIR and Why Is It Controversial?</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-09/india-s-voter-roll-revision-what-is-sir-and-why-is-it-controversial</link>
